      <Corpo> &lt;html xmlns:v=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml&quot; xmlns:o=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; xmlns:w=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word&quot; xmlns:m=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40&quot;&gt;     &lt;body lang=IT style=&apos;tab-interval:35.4pt&apos;&gt;  &lt;div class=WordSection1&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;span style=&apos;mso-spacerun:yes&apos;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;It is possible to identify the model of the gearbox by reading the plate at the top.&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;span style=&apos;mso-spacerun:yes&apos;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;The abbreviation &lt;B&gt;1 &lt;/B&gt;identifies the code of the gearbox.&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;span style=&apos;mso-spacerun:yes&apos;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Acronym &lt;B&gt;2 &lt;/B&gt;identifies the production date (dd.mm.yy).&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;span style=&apos;mso-spacerun:yes&apos;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Acronym &lt;B&gt;3 &lt;/B&gt;identifies the manufacturing plant.&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;span style=&apos;mso-spacerun:yes&apos;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Initial &lt;B&gt;4 &lt;/B&gt;identifies the production time.&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;span style=&apos;mso-spacerun:yes&apos;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;Initial &lt;B&gt;5 &lt;/B&gt;identifies the serial number.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/body&gt;  &lt;/html&gt;</Corpo>
