      <Capitolo>Automatic transmission oil drain and fill procedure</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;html xmlns:v=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml&quot; xmlns:o=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; xmlns:w=&quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word&quot; xmlns:m=&quot;http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/2004/12/omml&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40&quot;&gt;     &lt;body lang=IT style=&apos;tab-interval:35.4pt&apos;&gt;  &lt;div class=WordSection1&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:12.0pt; line-height:107%;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; The gearbox must not be in recovery mode&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Place the vehicle on a level&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Lift the vehicle&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Place the shift lever in &lt;B&gt;P&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Make sure the parking brake is engaged&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Turn off the engine&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Remove the bottom cover&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Position at the gearbox, the oil extractor pan &lt;B&gt;VAS 6622A&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Unscrew the drain plug &lt;B&gt;A&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Unscrew the overflow tube &lt;B&gt;B &lt;/B&gt;and drain the gearbox oil&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Unscrew the drain plug of the mechatronic module &lt;B&gt;C&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Allow the oil to drain completely&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Wait about &lt;B&gt;4 minutes &lt;/B&gt;for all the gearbox oil to drain out&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Reinstall the drain plug of the mechatronic module &lt;B&gt;C &lt;/B&gt;and tighten it to &lt;B&gt;10 ~ 20 Nm + 45°.&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt;CAUTION: &lt;/B&gt;Always replace the seal of the mechatronic module drain plug&lt;B&gt;.&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Screw the overflow plug &lt;B&gt;B &lt;/B&gt;back on and tighten it to &lt;B&gt;3 Nm.&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; The cap must be screwed on easily&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Shake the bottles well so that no sediment remains at the bottom&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Screw the gearbox oil bottle to the &lt;B&gt;VAS 6262A &lt;/B&gt;refueling adapter.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; If necessary, use the &lt;B&gt;VAS 6262/6 &lt;/B&gt;adapter.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Insert the adapter &lt;B&gt;VAS 6262A &lt;/B&gt;inside the overflow tube &lt;B&gt;B &lt;/B&gt;by hand-tightening it &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Hold the bottle and adapter &lt;B&gt;VAS 6262A &lt;/B&gt;as high as possible above the gearbox and allow &lt;B&gt;5.5~6.0 liters &lt;/B&gt;of automatic transmission oil to flow&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt;CAUTION: &lt;/B&gt;Should the temperature of the transmission oil exceed &lt;B&gt;45 °C &lt;/B&gt;during filling, stop the operation and allow the transmission oil to cool.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Remove the &lt;B&gt;VAS 6262A &lt;/B&gt;refueling adapter.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:12.0pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Screw the drain plug &lt;B&gt;A &lt;/B&gt;back on and tighten it to &lt;B&gt;45 Nm.&lt;/B&gt;&lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;B&gt;CAUTION: &lt;/B&gt;Always replace the gasket of the drain plug &lt;B&gt;A&lt;/B&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal style=&apos;margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt&apos;&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Start the engine and leave it running at idle&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Depress the brake pedal with the engine idling and put the lever in each position by pausing for at least &lt;B&gt;3 &lt;/B&gt;seconds&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Place the shift lever in &lt;B&gt;P &lt;/B&gt;without turning off the engine&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;p class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;mso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&apos;&gt;&amp;#61623; Check the oil level of the automatic transmission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;  &lt;/div&gt;  &lt;/body&gt;  &lt;/html&gt;</Corpo>
      <RifIDFileIMGANI>299007253</RifIDFileIMGANI>
